  "description": "The SUPREME DH V5 SIGNATURE is a high-end build featuring FOX Factory suspension.\n• The FOX 40 Factory fork and its Grip X2 cartridge offer a wide range of adjustments that allow you to adapt and overcome all trails. The FOX DHX2 shock absorber in Factory version, which includes 4 adjustment circuits, provides optimal support and shock filtration for maximum comfort.\n• Braking is handled by the proven SRAM Maven Silver 4-piston brakes with 223mm discs. They guarantee power and crisp feel in all circumstances.\n• The rims are a combination of DT SWISS FR541 front and FR571 rear, hand-built on 350 hubs, they are ideal for Gravity use.\n• The transmission is provided by SRAM with the GX DH group. 7-speed shifting is precise and ideal for downhill riding.",
